{"results":[{"url":"https://www.sqmtrs.com/project/211713-Sanskruti-Splendour-Dahisar-East-Mumbai","title":"Sanskruti Splendour in Dahisar | Price & Floor Plan | SQMTRS","raw_content":"![SQMTRS Logo](https://www.sqmtrs.com/images/logo-light.svg)\n![SQMTRS Small Logo](https://www.sqmtrs.com/images/logo-sm-light.svg)\n![User Profile Avatar](https://www.sqmtrs.com/images/dummy-user.png)\n\n## Customer Service\n\nCall: +91 88288 11511\n\nEmail: support@sqmtrs.com\n\n![Sanskruti Splendour - Exterior Building View](https://www.sqmtrs.com/ProjectsImages/211713_1.jpg)\n\n# Sanskruti Splendour By: [Sanskruti Nirman](https://www.sqmtrs.com/developer/21428-Sanskruti-Nirman)\n\n##### 1.85 Cr\\* Onwards\n\nPrice\n[See Offers & Deals](#project-experts)\n\n![Sanskruti Splendour - Exterior Building View](https://www.sqmtrs.com/ProjectsImages/211713_1.jpg)\n![Sanskruti Splendour photo 2](https://www.sqmtrs.com/ProjectsImages/th_211713_3.jpg)\n\n## Basic Details about Sanskruti Splendour\n\n## About Project\n\n## Unit Details & Floor Plans\n\n![2 BHK Flats Floor Plan - Carpet Area : 689 sq.ft](https://www.sqmtrs.com/FloorPlans/th_211713_1.jpg)\n\n## Amenities\n\n## Specifications\n\n###### BATHROOM & W.C.\n\n###### ELECTRIFICATION\n\n###### FLOORING\n\n###### KITCHEN\n\n###### WINDOWS\n\n## Location\n\nAbout Airoli\n\nAiroli is a residential and commercial area of Navi Mumbai in the Indian state of Maharashtra. It is a part of the Mumbai Metropolitan Region and is administered by Navi Mumbai Municipal Corporation. It is connected to Mulund via Mulund Airoli bridge, to Thane by Kalwa bridge and to the rest of Navi Mumbai via Thane Belapur Highway.\n\nSanskruti Splendour Location Map\n\nDahisar East, Navi Mumbai\n\n## Home Loan\n\nApproved for this project by the following bank/s:\n\n![State Bank Of India](https://www.sqmtrs.com/images/banks/SBI.jpg)\n![HDFC Bank](https://www.sqmtrs.com/images/banks/HDFC.jpg)\n![ICICI Bank](https://www.sqmtrs.com/images/banks/ICICI.jpg)\n![IDBI Bank](h